# Cloudflare Pages: paths listed here are NOT uploaded as public assets.
#
# `wrangler pages deploy site` publishes EVERYTHING in this directory, so anything dropped in here
# becomes a live URL. Two zip bundles (a stale full-site archive and a manual-upload delta) were
# sitting here and would have been served at projectstarfish.ca/site.zip -- harmless content, but
# stale copies of the site are exactly the sort of thing that shouldn't be publicly fetchable.
*.zip
*.tgz
README.md
